---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
warning[pointer_lifetime]: `p` points into `xs`, which may be resized: grow(*xs)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/regions-bad.jai:35:10
   |
32 |     p := xs.data;
   |             ---- pointer derived here
   ...
34 |     grow(*xs);
   |     --------- `xs` storage invalidated here
35 |     sink(p);
   |          ^ pointer used here after its storage was invalidated
   |
   = help: take the pointer again after growth, or store an index instead
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/pointer_lifetime

